  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNESCO and Inst. 10-13</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">UNESCO och Instit. 10-13</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xf6;d t UNESCO. Inom detta avtal (PCA-Programme cooperation agreement) st&#xf6;djer Sida CapEFA inom UNESCO, GMR-Global Monitoring Report, och de separata instituten UIL och IIEP, samt sekonderingar inom gender och  ESD (education for sustainable development). Under 2012 och 2013      finns 2 MSEK/&#xe5;r som &#xe4;nnu ej &#xe4;r allokerade. Vilket omr&#xe5;de som ska      st&#xf6;djas best&#xe4;ms map resultat av utv&#xe4;rderingen.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to UNESCO contains CapEFA (capacity buildning for Education   For All), GRM (Global Monitoring Report),separate institutes UIL      (Unesco Institute for Lifelong Learning), IIEP (International         Institute for Educaitonal Planning) and two experts in gender and     ESD. During the last two years of agreement there is 2 MSEK (2012 and 2013) not yet decided, to be allocated acc to evaluation.</narrative>
  </description>
